entries:
The castle that appeared as if it were
enveloping the Pokémon League{VAR BE00}
is a symbol.{VAR BE00}
It means Unova will change.{VAR BE01}

The king of this castle is the strongest
Trainer in the world.{VAR BE01}
He is accompanied by the
legendary Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
He has defeated the Champion.{VAR BE01}
Added to all that, his heart burns
with the desire to improve the world.{VAR BE01}
If that's not what makes a hero,
what more do you need?{VAR BE01}

Now that the stage is set, we can
seize people's minds and hearts.{VAR BE01}
We can bring into being the world
that I--no, that Team Plasma--desires{VAR BE00}
more easily than you can imagine!{VAR BE01}
We and only we will use Pokémon, and
we shall rule the powerless populace!{VAR BE01}

I've been waiting so long for this!{VAR BE01}
I've kept my silence so no one
could piece together what I planned.{VAR BE00}
Now, those painful days are at an end!{VAR BE01}
